<details>
  <summary>What's the difference between Free and Pro?</summary>
  <p>Free covers Safari highlighting on Mac and iPhone, your library and iCloud sync. Pro adds AI Access for compatible AI tools and on-device AI context.</p>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Is Pro a subscription?</summary>
  <p>No. Pro is a one-time in-app purchase through the App Store. It doesn't include an AI tool or any fees from its provider.</p>
</details>
